    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Weapon (Any Simple or Martial with the Ammunition Property), Uncommon (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>This magic weapon grants a +1 bonus to attack and damage rolls made with it when it’s used to make a ranged attack, and it ignores the Loading property if it has that property.</p><p>If the weapon lacks ammunition, it produces its own, automatically creating one piece of magic ammunition when the wielder makes a ranged attack roll with it. The ammunition created by the weapon vanishes the instant after it hits or misses a target.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-8aVwB7FDUqRsLYhi\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Glissez l’enchantement sur l’arme voulue : elle garde son nom, sa rareté et son prix. Elle reçoit le bonus de +1 et perd la propriété Loading. Quand vous n’avez plus de munitions, attaquez sans en choisir.</p></section><p>@Embed[Compendium.dnd5e.content24.JournalEntry.dmgFoundryRefere.JournalEntryPage.Ok4iCgD25ENgoRxE cite=false caption=false classes=\"hide-in-embed\"]</p>",
